height:1.2;font-size:8pt!important;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\"><br></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;line-height:1.2;font-size:8pt!important;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\">I think this may trip up a lot of people, especially those transitioning from plyr.  I&#39;m not sure how you&#39;d<br>emphasize this fact in the documentation, but it&#39;s worth a try.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><table style=\"width:1183px\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;line-height:1.2;font-size:8pt!important;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\" height=\"\" width=\"1\"><br></td></tr></tbody></table></font></span></td></tr></tbody></table></span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
